{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2022-05-10 17:16:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: WEISS LAW INVESTIGATES BIOHAVEN PHARMACEUTICAL HOLDING COMPANY LTD.', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WEISS LAW\xa0IS INVESTIGATING POSSIBLE BREACHES OF FIDUCIARY DUTY AND OTHER VIOLATIONS OF LAW BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF BIOHAVEN PHARMACEUTICAL HOLDING COMPANY LTD. ("BIOHAVEN" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: BHVN) IN CONNECTION WITH THE PROPOSED ACQUISITION OF THE COMPANY BY PFIZER INC. ("PFIZER") (NYSE: PFE).'}